        {
          "title": "-ir → -i, -re → -u",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "*-ir* verbs like *finir* have participles in *-i*: *fini, choisi, dormi*. *-re* verbs like *attendre* have participles in *-u*: *attendu, perdu, vendu, répondu*."
            },
